# Meshy uses the official CLI (meshy-cli) with browser sign-in.
# Install: npm install -g meshy-cli  (requires Node.js 22.12+)
# Authenticate from Asset Generation → Meshy → Log in
#   (runs `meshy auth login`; credentials stay in the CLI store).
#
# Optional CI / unattended only — not required for interactive editor use:
# MESHY_API_KEY=

# Google Drive external libraries (Project Art Library)
# Create a Desktop OAuth client in Google Cloud Console, enable Drive API,
# then either set env vars or create .google-drive-oauth.json:
#   { "clientId": "...", "clientSecret": "..." }
# GOOGLE_DRIVE_CLIENT_ID=
# GOOGLE_DRIVE_CLIENT_SECRET=
# Optional public-folder API key (still prefer OAuth for private shares):
# GOOGLE_API_KEY=
